{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这里错了。\\n　这里要这样做，可以更有效率些……」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": "「这里错了。　这里要这样做，可以更有效率些……」", "plain_idx": 300, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0496", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，原来如此……懂了，谢谢你」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用客气」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0497", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也不知道是不是因为每天都来，\\n我也习惯濑名同学的居家服打扮了。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": "也不知道是不是因为每天都来，我也习惯濑名同学的居家服打扮了。", "plain_idx": 306, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "倒不如说，我甚至开始觉得，\\n这身打扮让人能放松下来也不错啊。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": "倒不如说，我甚至开始觉得，这身打扮让人能放松下来也不错啊。", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，我还是\\n尽量不以“男性”的视线去看她。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": "不过，我还是尽量不以“男性”的视线去看她。", "plain_idx": 310, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这方面我已经以樱乃为对象练习过了。", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0498", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了吗？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事……我就是在想，我也已经习惯你待在我的房间里了」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "「没事……我就是在想，我也已经习惯你待在我的房间里了」", "plain_idx": 315, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0499", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这种事情怎么说呢，\\n　习惯了不是更好吗？」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "「这种事情怎么说呢，　习惯了不是更好吗？」", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话是这么说，但内心还是很复杂啊。\\n　我为什么会在男生面前穿成这样啊」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "「话是这么说，但内心还是很复杂啊。　我为什么会在男生面前穿成这样啊」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0500", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我作为男生也不好评价啊」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说……」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0501", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学抬起头。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「把洒落在地毯上的茶叶清扫出来，\\n　这就是专业女仆的智慧」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": "「把洒落在地毯上的茶叶清扫出来，　这就是专业女仆的智慧」", "plain_idx": 328, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0266", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想试试看」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0343", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我来啦。今天纱纱也一起来了。\\n　给，呵呵，这是慰问品」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": "「我来啦。今天纱纱也一起来了。　给，呵呵，这是慰问品」", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0171", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐今天来的地方还是有一只臭虫！\\n　爱理也是，你怎么了，穿着这身打扮教人学习。\\n　说到底还是个雌性啊？」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "「学姐今天来的地方还是有一只臭虫！　爱理也是，你怎么了，穿着这身打扮教人学习。　说到底还是个雌性啊？」", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 55, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0087", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我家已经彻底成了聚会所啊」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0502", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "确实是这个情况……", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，今天还是乾同学第一次来。", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「话说，让乾同学过来，呃，没问题吗？」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「算了，事到如今，\\n　再多一个纱凪也一样了……\\n　唉，也不知道是谁的错，我自己也越来越松懈了啊」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": "「算了，事到如今，　再多一个纱凪也一样了……　唉，也不知道是谁的错，我自己也越来越松懈了啊」", "plain_idx": 347, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0503", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪！你应该知道的吧，\\n　要是把这件事说出去了就别想有好果子吃了」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "「纱凪！你应该知道的吧，　要是把这件事说出去了就别想有好果子吃了」", "plain_idx": 350, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0504", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么嘛，区区爱理我都没在怕的。\\n　毕竟咱俩打交道的时间最长了～」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": "「什么嘛，区区爱理我都没在怕的。　毕竟咱俩打交道的时间最长了～」", "plain_idx": 353, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0088", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算知道了这件事我也没什么幻想好破灭的，\\n　你就好好看着吧，我对大家也会保密的」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": "「就算知道了这件事我也没什么幻想好破灭的，　你就好好看着吧，我对大家也会保密的」", "plain_idx": 356, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0089", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱口风很紧呢」", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0172", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「放心交给我吧美羽学姐」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0090", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这样啊，乾同学这个样子还算是在容许范围内，是这个意思吧。", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天羽学姐的存在也是一大原因吧。", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是这样我也来打搅了」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0091", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打扰了。\\n　慰问品我放冰箱里了～」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": "「打扰了。　慰问品我放冰箱里了～」", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0173", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊真是的！要坐的话只剩垫子了……\\n　也只剩一个了么，那就随便找地方坐吧！」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": "「啊真是的！要坐的话只剩垫子了……　也只剩一个了么，那就随便找地方坐吧！」", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0505", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "最后，今天又多了个乾同学，\\n大家一起学习。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": "最后，今天又多了个乾同学，大家一起学习。", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在来爱理同学的房间，\\n　不用多说也会自带学习用具了呢」", "text_idx": 374, "plain": "「现在来爱理同学的房间，　不用多说也会自带学习用具了呢」", "plain_idx": 375, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0267", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「空间狭窄还是有点辛苦啊」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0344", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这也不是我的问题吧，\\n　不乐意的话就赶紧回去！」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": "「这也不是我的问题吧，　不乐意的话就赶紧回去！」", "plain_idx": 380, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0506", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一周时间，不只是我，\\n大家都会自带学习用具。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": "这一周时间，不只是我，大家都会自带学习用具。", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，濑名同学嘴上说着不乐意，但当有人遇到困难的时候，\\n还是会很热心地指导的……", "text_idx": 384, "plain": "当然，濑名同学嘴上说着不乐意，但当有人遇到困难的时候，还是会很热心地指导的……", "plain_idx": 385, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就，先集中精力学习一个小时，怎么样？\\n　准备……开始」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": "「那就，先集中精力学习一个小时，怎么样？　准备……开始」", "plain_idx": 387, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学所营造出的这种认真学习的氛围也是一大原因。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要她先带头开始学习，\\n剩下的人也会不可思议地、自己集中精神开始学习。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": "只要她先带头开始学习，剩下的人也会不可思议地、自己集中精神开始学习。", "plain_idx": 391, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在绝不算宽敞的六叠房间内，\\n大家并肩学习——", "text_idx": 392, "plain": "在绝不算宽敞的六叠房间内，大家并肩学习——", "plain_idx": 393, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——今天复习考试复习到了天黑。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": "——今天复习考试复习到了天黑。", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔姆」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
