{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「经历这么多，大家也越来越能干了……\\n　这样一来应该能拿到不错的分数吧」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": "「经历这么多，大家也越来越能干了……　这样一来应该能拿到不错的分数吧」", "plain_idx": 400, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0509", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，谢谢你，有你在真是帮大忙了」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
