{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吧？」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0174", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0345", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「倒不如说是被硬拉过来学习了……\\n　我明明只是来玩的……」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": "「倒不如说是被硬拉过来学习了……　我明明只是来玩的……」", "plain_idx": 410, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0092", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，总之，今天的补习就到这结束了」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天和后天就自己进行最后冲刺吧。\\n　明白了吗？」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": "「明天和后天就自己进行最后冲刺吧。　明白了吗？」", "plain_idx": 415, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0511", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她在最后又加上了这句话，\\n这一周不到的复习时间，也暂且告一段落了。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": "她在最后又加上了这句话，这一周不到的复习时间，也暂且告一段落了。", "plain_idx": 418, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……真是糟透了啊」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0512", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不仅暴露了住所，就连房间\\n　也变成了考试前的聚会所……」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": "「不仅暴露了住所，就连房间　也变成了考试前的聚会所……」", "plain_idx": 422, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0513", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那啥，真的，各种方面都多谢了」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，你别这时候露出\\n　一脸过意不去的表情啊」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": "「喂，你别这时候露出　一脸过意不去的表情啊」", "plain_idx": 426, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0514", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我说过这是相互的吧。\\n　我才要说谢谢啊，那个时候你帮了我大忙」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": "「……我说过这是相互的吧。　我才要说谢谢啊，那个时候你帮了我大忙」", "plain_idx": 429, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0515", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "让濑名同学害羞了。", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我总觉得——这比学习进步更有成就感。", "text_idx": 432, "plain": "我总觉得——这比学习进步更有成就感。", "plain_idx": 432, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
