{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……难道说，濑名同学」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没什么！那就先休息一会吧，\\n　好了拿出碟子，到最后的活动了赶快完事！！」", "text_idx": 467, "plain": "「没什么！那就先休息一会吧，　好了拿出碟子，到最后的活动了赶快完事！！」", "plain_idx": 468, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0522", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
