{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁」", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0093", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明白了纱纱。\\n　就是说啊就是说啊很可疑呢」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": "「明白了纱纱。　就是说啊就是说啊很可疑呢」", "plain_idx": 474, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0270", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是这样爱理同学，还请你大人有大量，\\n　原谅我们无礼的行为」", "text_idx": 476, "plain": "「就是这样爱理同学，还请你大人有大量，　原谅我们无礼的行为」", "plain_idx": 477, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0271", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁刚站起身，\\n就对着濑名同学深深地低下了头。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": "安洁刚站起身，就对着濑名同学深深地低下了头。", "plain_idx": 480, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊？要、要干嘛啊安洁——」", "text_idx": 481, "plain": "「啊？要、要干嘛啊安洁——」", "plain_idx": 481, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0523", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%164;跳！", "text_idx": 483, "plain": "ぎゅぴーん！", "plain_idx": 484, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咿呀、等下、哎、住手、住手啊哈哈哈哈哈！！」", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0524", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「女仆必杀技之挠痒痒之舞————！！」", "text_idx": 487, "plain": "「メイド殺法くすぐりの舞いーーーーっ！！」", "plain_idx": 488, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0272", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「住手、赶快、啊哈哈、\\n　不行、啊、啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！」", "text_idx": 490, "plain": "「住手、赶快、啊哈哈、　不行、啊、啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！」", "plain_idx": 491, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0525", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "安洁像一只怪鸟一般扑向濑名同学，\\n然后发动了猛烈的挠痒痒攻势！", "text_idx": 493, "plain": "安洁像一只怪鸟一般扑向濑名同学，然后发动了猛烈的挠痒痒攻势！", "plain_idx": 494, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈、啊哈哈、不、不行、啊哈哈哈、不行啊哈哈哈、\\n　哈哈哈哈！」", "text_idx": 495, "plain": "「啊哈、啊哈哈、不、不行、啊哈哈哈、不行啊哈哈哈、　哈哈哈哈！」", "plain_idx": 496, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0526", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学又哭又笑，在地上翻滚着大叫，\\n和她之前相比甚至像是变了一个人。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": "濑名同学又哭又笑，在地上翻滚着大叫，和她之前相比甚至像是变了一个人。", "plain_idx": 499, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「求你了、住手、哈、啊哈哈、快住手安洁\\n　哈哈哈哈、咿呀、啊啊、啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！！」", "text_idx": 500, "plain": "「求你了、住手、哈、啊哈哈、快住手安洁　哈哈哈哈、咿呀、啊啊、啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！！」", "plain_idx": 501, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0527", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘻嘻嘻嘻。\\n　在安洁手里无论是爱理同学还是谁，\\n　都会变成绝赞的青春有活力的少女哦～～！」", "text_idx": 503, "plain": "「嘻嘻嘻嘻。　在安洁手里无论是爱理同学还是谁，　都会变成绝赞的青春有活力的少女哦～～！」", "plain_idx": 504, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0273", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不行、不行哈哈、要死了、要死了、\\n　我已经不行了、啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈！」", "text_idx": 506, "plain": "「不行、不行哈哈、要死了、要死了、　我已经不行了、啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈！」", "plain_idx": 507, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0528", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「快招了吧爱理！\\n　不然安洁可能会挠你一晚上的！」", "text_idx": 509, "plain": "「快招了吧爱理！　不然安洁可能会挠你一晚上的！」", "plain_idx": 510, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0094", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我说我说我说还不行吗\\n　啊哈哈哈哈哈别挠啦～～～！」", "text_idx": 512, "plain": "「我说我说我说还不行吗　啊哈哈哈哈哈别挠啦～～～！」", "plain_idx": 513, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0529", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「搞得这么闹腾，我去和附近邻居道个歉……」", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再怎么说，我也看不下去了……", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天10月24日，似乎是濑名同学的生日。", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "通用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……………………」", "text_idx": 519, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "众人", "alt_speaker_idx": 518, "voice": "go032a", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们一句话都说不出口。", "text_idx": 521, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没关系的，又不是什么特别值得庆祝的事情，\\n　而且考试前夕也不是做这种事的时候吧……」", "text_idx": 522, "plain": "「没关系的，又不是什么特别值得庆祝的事情，　而且考试前夕也不是做这种事的时候吧……」", "plain_idx": 523, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0530", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学撅着嘴，\\n红着脸嘟嘟囔囔说个不停。", "text_idx": 525, "plain": "濑名同学撅着嘴，红着脸嘟嘟囔囔说个不停。", "plain_idx": 526, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然说瞒着你们或许确实是我不好，\\n　不过我要是说出来了岂不搞得像是我在催你们给我过生日一样么，\\n　再说了今天本来应该只有我一个人的……」", "text_idx": 527, "plain": "「虽然说瞒着你们或许确实是我不好，　不过我要是说出来了岂不搞得像是我在催你们给我过生日一样么，　再说了今天本来应该只有我一个人的……」", "plain_idx": 528, "len": 71, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0531", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然，确实可能是这样……", "text_idx": 530, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……而且，就算是我和母亲在一起生活的时候，\\n　无论是什么纪念日也都没有好好庆祝过……」", "text_idx": 531, "plain": "「……而且，就算是我和母亲在一起生活的时候，　无论是什么纪念日也都没有好好庆祝过……」", "plain_idx": 532, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0532", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——我们大吃一惊，\\n相互看了一眼，\\n她说这句话的语气明显不同。", "text_idx": 534, "plain": "——我们大吃一惊，相互看了一眼，她说这句话的语气明显不同。", "plain_idx": 535, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是她强制压抑住自己的感情、勉强挤出的低沉声音。", "text_idx": 536, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我突然觉得喘不上气来。", "text_idx": 537, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以我也并不是——」", "text_idx": 538, "plain": "「所以我也并不是——」", "plain_idx": 538, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0533", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过。", "text_idx": 540, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「别说了，现在就来庆祝吧！」", "text_idx": 541, "plain": "「いいから今すぐやろう！」", "plain_idx": 542, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我强迫自己呼出一口气。", "text_idx": 543, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学则——震惊得说不出话来。", "text_idx": 544, "plain": "濑名同学则——震惊得说不出话来。", "plain_idx": 544, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那么……三、二、一」", "text_idx": 545, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "通用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「生日快乐～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 546, "plain": "「お誕生日、おめでとう～～～～っ！！」", "plain_idx": 547, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "众人", "alt_speaker_idx": 518, "voice": "go039", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——在这之后没过多久。", "text_idx": 549, "plain": "——在这之后没过多久。", "plain_idx": 549, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们准备好茶水、在蛋糕上点上蜡烛，\\n举行了一场简朴的庆生宴。", "text_idx": 550, "plain": "我们准备好茶水、在蛋糕上点上蜡烛，举行了一场简朴的庆生宴。", "plain_idx": 551, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其实为了让生日宴更有氛围，\\n我们也可以先出去买点东西回来的……", "text_idx": 552, "plain": "其实为了让生日宴更有氛围，我们也可以先出去买点东西回来的……", "plain_idx": 553, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过当时大家都有些坐立难安。", "text_idx": 554, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0534", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只想尽早为濑名同学庆生。", "text_idx": 556, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为——她其实是想过生日的，\\n这压抑在她内心的想法已经完全表露出来了。", "text_idx": 557, "plain": "因为——她其实是想过生日的，这压抑在她内心的想法已经完全表露出来了。", "plain_idx": 558, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，越快越好，要以无可辩驳的速度去庆祝。", "text_idx": 559, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那个」", "text_idx": 560, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0535", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「来～是要先吹灭蜡烛、\\n　还是先干杯呢？\\n　随你喜欢哦～～♪」", "text_idx": 562, "plain": "「来～是要先吹灭蜡烛、　还是先干杯呢？　随你喜欢哦～～♪」", "plain_idx": 563, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0277", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不、不对」", "text_idx": 565, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0536", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没关系，这颗草莓是爱理的」", "text_idx": 567, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0349", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我、就是」", "text_idx": 569, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0537", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「搞什么嘛，这是值得庆祝的日子啊，\\n　开心点啊～来嘛来嘛，耶！」", "text_idx": 571, "plain": "「搞什么嘛，这是值得庆祝的日子啊，　开心点啊～来嘛来嘛，耶！」", "plain_idx": 572, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0097", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、不……」", "text_idx": 574, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0538", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样一来，\\n　小爱又在大人的台阶上迈进了一步呢」", "text_idx": 576, "plain": "「这样一来，　小爱又在大人的台阶上迈进了一步呢」", "plain_idx": 577, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0180", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0539", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学这时——很不自在地、\\n从心底感到害羞一般地，缩起了身体。", "text_idx": 580, "plain": "濑名同学这时——很不自在地、从心底感到害羞一般地，缩起了身体。", "plain_idx": 581, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就好像，受到惊吓的小孩子一样。", "text_idx": 582, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉……」", "text_idx": 583, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，对于这样的濑名同学，我投以微笑。\\n就和条件反射一样，和刚才一样。", "text_idx": 584, "plain": "所以，对于这样的濑名同学，我投以微笑。就和条件反射一样，和刚才一样。", "plain_idx": 585, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我们做的事情或许和你想象的完全不一样」", "text_idx": 586, "plain": "「我们做的事情或许和你想象的完全不一样」", "plain_idx": 586, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0540", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学看向了我。", "text_idx": 588, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……没有」", "text_idx": 589, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0541", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "呼。", "text_idx": 591, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 2, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "闻言，我露出松了一口气的奇怪表情。", "text_idx": 592, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我只是觉得，这样好像也不错……」", "text_idx": 593, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0542", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那声音像是她咬着牙发出来的。", "text_idx": 595, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我……举起了玻璃杯。", "text_idx": 596, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
